{
  "info": {
    "name": "Greenhouse API",
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-greenhouse001",
    "description": "Complete REST API for the Greenhouse Management Server.\n\n## Quick start\n1. Run **Auth / Login** — the JWT is automatically saved to `{{jwt}}`\n2. All other requests use Bearer `{{jwt}}` via collection-level auth\n3. Update `{{baseUrl}}` if your server runs on a different port\n\n## MQTTX testing (simulate Arduino without a physical device)\n1. Download MQTTX from https://mqttx.app/\n2. Create a connection to your broker — by default `mqtt://localhost:1883`\n3. **Subscribe** to `greenhouse/+/set/model` — you will see every model the server pushes to devices\n4. Use **MQTT Debug / Publish (simulate Arduino telemetry)** from this collection to trigger a round-trip, OR publish manually from MQTTX to `greenhouse/<ip>/status` with the payload:\n   ```json\n   {\"id\":1,\"zones\":[{\"id\":1,\"parameters\":[{\"id\":5,\"val\":23.5}],\"flowerpots\":[{\"id\":1,\"parameters\":[{\"id\":10,\"val\":62.0}]}]}]}\n   ```\n5. After publishing, MQTTX will show the full model the server pushed back to `greenhouse/<ip>/set/model`\n\n## Parameter field names (Arduino contract)\n- `mutable` (not `mutableFlag`)\n- `parameterType`: `\"Toggle\"` or `\"Value\"` (Arduino uses `equalsIgnoreCase(\"TOGGLE\")`)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",      "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "jwt",          "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "greenhouseId", "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "zoneId",       "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "flowerpotId",  "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "parameterId",  "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "plantId",      "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId",       "value": "1",                     "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{jwt}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new user account. Returns 200 'User created' or 400 'User already exists'."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// The server sets the JWT in the Authorization response header.",
                  "var authHeader = pm.response.headers.get('Authorization');",
                  "if (authHeader && authHeader.startsWith('Bearer ')) {",
                  "    var token = authHeader.substring(7);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt', token);",
                  "    console.log('JWT saved (' + token.length + ' chars)');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn('Authorization header not found in response');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate and receive a JWT. The test script automatically saves the token to `{{jwt}}` so all subsequent requests are authorized."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Greenhouse",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get all greenhouses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ""]
            },
            "description": "Returns a list of all greenhouses with their zones, parameters, status, and lastUpdate."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get greenhouse by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}", "description": "Greenhouse ID" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add greenhouse",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Main Greenhouse\",\n  \"location\": \"Backyard\",\n  \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.1.100\",\n  \"parameters\": []\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/add",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", "add"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new greenhouse. `ipAddress` must be a valid IPv4 address — used as the MQTT routing key."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update greenhouse",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Main Greenhouse (updated)\",\n  \"location\": \"North Wing\",\n  \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.1.100\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:greenhouseId",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":greenhouseId"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "greenhouseId", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete greenhouse",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:greenhouseId",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":greenhouseId"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "greenhouseId", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add zone to greenhouse",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Zone A\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:id/addZone",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":id", "addZone"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete zone from greenhouse",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:greenhouseId/deleteZone/:zoneId",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":greenhouseId", "deleteZone", ":zoneId"],
              "variable": [
                { "key": "greenhouseId", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}" },
                { "key": "zoneId",       "value": "{{zoneId}}" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add parameter to greenhouse",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"AmbientTemperature\",\n  \"mutable\": false,\n  \"currentValue\": 21.0,\n  \"requestedValue\": null,\n  \"min\": 10.0,\n  \"max\": 40.0,\n  \"unit\": \"C\",\n  \"parameterType\": \"Value\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:id/addParameter",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":id", "addParameter"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get greenhouse parameters",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:id/parameters",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":id", "parameters"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Push model to device (MQTT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/greenhouse/:id/push",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["greenhouse", ":id", "push"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{greenhouseId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Manually push the full greenhouse model to the Arduino over MQTT (`greenhouse/<ip>/set/model`). Useful after changing configuration or when the device has re-connected."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Zone",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add flowerpot to zone",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
